Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.69,0:00:04.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak Kades, permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.62,0:00:19.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cantik sekali.\NIni Echigoya yang membuatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.67,0:00:23.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku menenunnya\Ndengan skill Pemintal Benang,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu menjahitnya dengan skill Menjahit.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, ya, siapa namamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.43,0:00:32.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa aku disuruh memakai baju ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.06,0:00:40.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau manis.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.19,0:00:43.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali kalau berpenampilan\Ncompang-camping, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.11,0:00:45.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Manis...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.11,0:00:49.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau senang kalau aku manis?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.45,0:00:52.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echigoya, buatkan aku baju yang lain!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga cantik, Karen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bajunya memang cocok.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.58,0:01:06.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kain ini nyaman sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malah mengalihkan pembicaraan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.88,0:01:11.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak tahu\NEchigoya bisa membuat kain sebagus ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.88,0:01:15.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memang berniat membagikan\Nteknologi kain ini kepada manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.72,0:01:16.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membagikannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.60,0:01:20.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau mungkin menjualnya\Ndan mendaftarkan hak patennya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.31,0:01:23.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akira, jangan-jangan kau
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,berniat menjadi Raja Iblis, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.24,0:01:33.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kegagalan Raja Iblis adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.03,0:01:39.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,menggunakan skill tersebut hanya untuk\Ndirinya sendiri dan para bawahannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.52,0:01:41.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari yang kupelajari,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia memonopoli kekuatannya
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menggunakannya untuk melawan manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajar dia menjadi musuh dunia.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.63,0:01:51.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu alasanmu ingin menyebarkan\Nteknologi kain ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memang mewarisi skill Raja Iblis,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku tidak berniat\Nmengulangi kesalahannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.15,0:03:34.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak Kades.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.15,0:03:37.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bahagia.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.45,0:03:41.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sama-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.96,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Pesta perkabungan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.96,0:03:50.25,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ayo, kita menari!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.96,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku mau bernyanyi!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill Heal yang kuwarisi hari ini
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.93,0:04:01.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah skill umum,\Njadi yang kudapat hanyalah duplikat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah menyaksikan akhir hayat\Nsekitar 500 Goblin,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi karena banyak duplikat,\Naku hanya mewarisi sekitar 300 skill.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.44,0:04:11.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah alasanku membuat sistem pewarisan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.94,0:04:14.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini kulakukan karena diminta,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi daripada aku yang sudah punya,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.53,0:04:19.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,lebih baik Goblin lain yang mewarisinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa lebih baik begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.53,0:04:24.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, skill yang duplikat jadi mubazir.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.74,0:04:25.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.83,0:04:27.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia kelihatan gugup.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.54,0:04:33.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti karyawan\Nyang menunggu hasil evaluasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.21,0:04:38.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baju barumu manis.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.63,0:04:42.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pujian begitu tidak membuatku senang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan hanya bajumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.43,0:04:45.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang manis.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka-Karena bajuku sebelumnya sudah sobek.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.31,0:04:52.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mubazir kalau tidak dipakai.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau bertanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.94,0:04:57.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Umurmu tinggal berapa hari lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.94,0:05:01.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku punya skill "Umur Manusia 80 Tahun".
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berbeda dengan Goblin lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.95,0:05:04.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bisa hidup sampai 80 tahun.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.41,0:05:06.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bohong. Mana ada skill seperti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bohong atau tidak,\Nlihat saja sendiri seminggu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.29,0:05:15.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya Goblin punya banyak skill,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,ternyata benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa skill kalian banyak\Nkarena siklus hidup kalian pendek?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.51,0:05:23.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, siklus hidup-mati kami singkat,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.93,0:05:26.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan kami selalu lahir\Ndengan satu skill bawaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, kami menjadi ras\Nyang punya skill paling banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.18,0:05:34.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, baru kali ini aku dengar\Nskill "Umur Manusia 80 Tahun".
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.48,0:05:38.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu skill unik seperti Hukum Alam\Nmilik Tuan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill unik?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.57,0:05:43.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu skill yang hanya dimiliki\Nsatu orang di dunia, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.07,0:05:44.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga punya, Chloe?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Punyaku bukan skill unik, tapi cukup langka.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill Pencarian dan Penglihatan Jauh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, kalau Penglihatan Jauh, aku juga punya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.96,0:05:55.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penglihatan Jauh!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.93,0:06:10.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa ini?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.93,0:06:11.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penglihatan Cakrawala?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe, coba pakai skill-mu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.33,0:06:35.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat, aku bisa melihat lebih jauh\Ndaripada sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat, hebat sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa memakai Penglihatan Cakrawala.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penglihatan Jauh juga tidak bisa aktif lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa mungkin skill kami bergabung
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.18,0:06:48.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan berevolusi menjadi skill tingkat lanjut?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.93,0:06:51.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bisa melakukan itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.31,0:06:55.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke-Kenapa tiba-tiba melompat?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menemukan cara\Nmemanfaatkan skill duplikat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanzo, kau punya\Nskill Penggandaan Diri, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.13,0:07:21.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa bedanya dengan Penggandaan Diri biasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sangat berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami memang hasil penggandaan,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi rasanya seperti tubuh asli semua.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.55,0:07:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya asli?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.93,0:07:33.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, Chloe pasti paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.93,0:07:37.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, mereka mirip sekali dengan aslinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.94,0:07:41.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat bertarung,\Naku hanya perlu melawan yang asli.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini, semuanya harus dikalahkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.94,0:07:48.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya, ini versi lanjutan dari\NPenggandaan Diri, Penggandaan Bayangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iri sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.78,0:07:51.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beruntungnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.83,0:07:54.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, kita berpesta untuk merayakan Hanzo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.29,0:07:56.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari tadi kita memang sedang berpesta, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, kita bertanding ulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dasar Goblin nekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kubuat kau babak belur lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo, ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe, semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanzo, semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.94,0:08:24.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau selalu membuatku terkejut.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.86,0:08:27.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak kusangka kau bisa mengevolusi skill.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.32,0:08:29.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, sudah ganti baju, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja. Aku sedang bertugas.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga sama kagetnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.95,0:08:36.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, kau baru tahu soal ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tahu, sudah lama kulakukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu bisa dilakukan pada siapa saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.67,0:08:45.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.17,0:08:48.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa jadi hanya berlaku\Nuntuk sesama Goblin, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.92,0:08:52.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena bisa kulakukan pada Chloe,\Nseharusnya ras lain juga bisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.56,0:08:57.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada kemungkinan hanya berlaku\Nuntuk iblis dan monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini hanya dugaanku, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.94,0:09:09.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktu itu, aku dipindahkan ke dunia ini\Nseolah disaring mesin pencari.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.95,0:09:15.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Evolusi skill barusan\Nmembawaku pada satu jawaban.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.49,0:09:17.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dunia ini
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,terbentuk atas kemauanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menggabungkan dan mengevolusi skill,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.63,0:09:26.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,sistem itu sejalan dengan pengetahuanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, semoga ini juga\Nbisa diterapkan pada ras lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.22,0:09:33.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak, aku bisa dianggap ancaman lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, ada segerombolan serangga.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita basmi mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.77,0:09:48.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.57,0:09:49.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, Pak Kades.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.07,0:09:51.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petualang, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.40,0:09:53.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tiba-tiba menyerang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, Hanzo melindungi kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi aku sudah berniat membunuh mereka,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi Hanzo melarang kami melawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.62,0:10:04.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hentikan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita bicarakan dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.92,0:10:10.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanzo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.63,0:10:13.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.84,0:10:14.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau apa kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.59,0:10:18.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja membasmi monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak menyerang kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.60,0:10:23.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, memangnya kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tujuan kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami mengincar gadis iblis itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untuk apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.94,0:10:36.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perlukah alasan untuk membasmi iblis\Nyang membahayakan manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.62,0:10:41.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sisa pasukan Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia pernah melukai manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah pasti.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.54,0:10:47.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah pasti?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.09,0:10:51.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serahkan dia, dan kalian para Goblin\Nakan kami biarkan hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.72,0:10:57.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Desa kami dilindungi oleh Tuan Wedana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.93,0:10:59.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian tidak tahu itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian dengar itu?\NKatanya dilindungi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak peduli.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.36,0:11:09.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya, kalian dianggap penyusup.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.07,0:11:12.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, kami tidak peduli.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, pergi dari desa kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.95,0:11:17.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian melanggar hukum desa kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini permintaan resmi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sombong sekali Goblin ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Konyol.\N- Permintaan resmi apanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.08,0:11:29.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karen.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.34,0:11:32.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku saksinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.59,0:11:35.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan ini,\Nkami sudah menjalani prosedur pembelaan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.13,0:11:38.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah keadilan prosedural.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.39,0:11:43.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bertahan, Hanzo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.52,0:11:44.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau boleh serius sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.06,0:11:51.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau serius pun, memangnya Goblin bisa apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya bisa apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya boleh melawan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.66,0:12:10.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Hore! Hanzo menang!\N- Kita lanjutkan pestanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kita buat anak, yuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita lanjut bertarung dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.38,0:12:19.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masalah sebenarnya baru saja dimulai.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita sudah mengikuti prosedur,\Nseharusnya aman, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.93,0:12:26.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soal itu memang benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.93,0:12:30.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kalau tersebar kabar\Nbahwa orang sekuat mereka
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,dikalahkan oleh satu Goblin,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.44,0:12:35.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,kekuatan tempur kalian akan diwaspadai.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.69,0:12:38.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Mereka seberpengaruh itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.74,0:12:40.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau punya cara menyembunyikan\Nkekuatan kalian?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan kusembunyikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak masalah diwaspadai?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau ada yang ditutupi,\Nkami justru akan sulit dipercaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.38,0:12:53.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika berhadapan dengan orang besar,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,diwaspadai pun seharusnya bukan masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.34,0:12:59.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlebih, kami tak bisa terus berada\Ndi posisi paling bawah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.22,0:13:02.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami juga perlu menyetarakan posisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.43,0:13:06.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, lebih baik mereka waspada.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.31,0:13:08.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, tak bisa semudah itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa jadi masalah besar\Njika manusia mewaspadai kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manusia tak akan menerima sesuatu\Nhanya karena itu benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada Goblin yang mengalahkan pemburu monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.94,0:13:20.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau rumor itu tersebar,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,manusia pasti akan ketakutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, akan kutarik simpati mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu Goblin, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.75,0:13:39.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka kelihatan kuat, tapi agak manis juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.51,0:13:41.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gadis itu siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.55,0:13:44.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan itu putri Goblin?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.05,0:13:46.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak tahu, tapi dia manis sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.06,0:13:50.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Echigoya, tolong buatkan dua pakaian.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.31,0:13:53.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, seragam gagah untuk Hanzo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, gaun manis untuk Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia tampil seperti putri yang lemah...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.61,0:14:03.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, itu tipemu, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, kau pasti cocok.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.83,0:14:10.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau memaksa, akan kupakai.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.04,0:14:12.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, satu permintaan lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katakan saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kalian dikasari oleh manusia...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.05,0:14:21.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan tertipu penampilan mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jangan melawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.85,0:14:28.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia itu ras iblis!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.35,0:14:30.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti dia datang kemari dengan niat buruk!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster kotor!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster rendahan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku takut.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.82,0:14:56.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau keterlaluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.17,0:14:58.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia hanya anak kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak malu melempari Goblin?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.59,0:15:02.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia seperti kesatria, keren!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.92,0:15:04.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mengerikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.34,0:15:07.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuai rencanamu, suasananya berubah drastis.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.43,0:15:09.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini berkat akting hebat Hanzo.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.89,0:15:11.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanzo?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah berkat Chloe?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.64,0:15:14.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia melindungi Chloe.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.06,0:15:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Konsep kesatria yang melindungi putri,\Nmudah diterima semua orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan ini, manusia takkan waspada\Nterhadap kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.24,0:15:26.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kastel raja manusia, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan raja, tapi Tuan Wedana.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.03,0:15:31.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beliau orang penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.62,0:15:36.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang, Sobatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.41,0:15:38.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf mengganggu, Simon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.21,0:15:40.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah dengar semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak bersalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.21,0:15:45.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah kalau begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, gadis itu yang...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Chloe takkan menyakiti manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.05,0:15:52.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang menjaminnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau yang bilang, aku percaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penglihatan Cakrawala!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.07,0:16:07.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada gelang nama di kaki burung itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, matamu tajam juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini berkat\Nskill Penglihatan Cakrawala dari Akira.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, sebenarnya apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.29,0:16:21.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih baik kalian melihatnya langsung.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.63,0:16:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belakangan ini,\Npara gadis kalangan atas di sini punya hobi
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang namanya balap burung.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.72,0:16:31.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setiap orang melepaskan burung bulbul.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.76,0:16:36.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, berlomba burung mana\Nyang pertama hinggap di dahan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.52,0:16:38.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, elegan juga, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hobi orang ningrat memang berbeda.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.23,0:16:46.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teman jandaku\Ningin punya burung bulbul yang tangguh,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.36,0:16:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena itu aku melatihnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.57,0:16:53.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia berjanji memberimu imbalan\Nkalau bulbulnya juara, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketahuan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jelas sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau coba denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak punya bulbul.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bisa diatur.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.59,0:17:10.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita bertaruh bulbul siapa\Nyang hinggap lebih dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku menang, aku minta Goblin kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.97,0:17:19.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau punya Goblin yang pintar menjahit, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.35,0:17:23.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau menyuruhnya\Nmembuat baju seksi untuk gadis-gadisku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, itu alasannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku yang menang?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.61,0:17:29.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.78,0:17:34.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berjanji hal seperti ini\Ntak akan terulang lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.79,0:17:40.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya memastikan manusia\Ntidak mengincar Chloe lagi, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.21,0:17:42.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tawaran bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.25,0:17:44.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik, ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semangat yang bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.75,0:17:49.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sobatku, pilihlah lebih dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sama sekali tidak paham soal burung.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pilih yang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akira kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia curang!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menarik burungnya\Nmemakai benang transparan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.03,0:18:19.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Wedana!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Besok, aku akan menyuruh Echigoya\Ndatang kemari.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.20,0:18:28.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak, Sobatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda memanggil saya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.05,0:18:37.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku diminta melaporkan\Ntingkat ancaman Goblin.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.35,0:18:39.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini laporanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa jawaban Anda?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.39,0:18:43.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengujinya lewat taruhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.60,0:18:45.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tenang dan sulit terpancing emosi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski kalah, mereka menerimanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.94,0:18:50.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tingkat ancamannya rendah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.36,0:18:51.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kutitipkan ini padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.66,0:18:57.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Goblin Slayer.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.37,0:19:06.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa Anda memberikan ini padaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sadar aku curang,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dia langsung mengakui kekalahannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.38,0:19:15.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia juga tak termakan umpanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.05,0:19:22.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Potensinya melampaui Goblin biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia terlalu berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.27,0:19:28.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gunakan itu dalam keadaan mendesak.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.23,0:19:33.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.74,0:19:36.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini desa kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.57,0:19:37.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pergi sekarang!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.70,0:19:38.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.49,0:19:40.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian monster musuh manusia!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.04,0:19:52.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terbakarlah sampai tak tersisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bercanda.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menahan diri,\Njadi tidak mungkin terbakar habis.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.05,0:20:00.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku hanya ingin mengucapkan\Nkalimat keren seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.41,0:20:04.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kubiarkan, dia pasti akan kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.64,0:20:11.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan pernah menyerang Goblin lebih dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.94,0:20:12.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku takkan menyerang Goblin lebih dulu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.53,0:20:25.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill berwujud api hitam pemusnah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seolah-olah...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hukum Alam.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.80,0:20:37.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill Raja Iblis yang membuat musuh\Ntakluk secara mutlak.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.72,0:20:42.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, ini pasti pengaruh senjata ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.35,0:20:46.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bagaimana kalau Goblin Slayer pun\Ntak mampu mengalahkannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah pikiranku juga\Nakan dimanipulasi olehnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.90,0:20:54.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karen?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.49,0:20:59.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karen, kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf. Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah? Wajahmu pucat.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.04,0:21:07.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak sepucat Goblin.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau jadi makin kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, dari anak yang meninggal kemarin,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.59,0:21:16.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku mewarisi skill yang sudah berevolusi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.17,0:21:20.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mewarisi skill yang berevolusi...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.51,0:21:21.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.05,0:21:23.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.85,0:21:27.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau dan para Goblin akan makin kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.31,0:21:31.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan Goblin Slayer pun\Ntak akan mampu mengalahkan kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.87,0:21:35.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo pergi, Karen.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.28,0:21:39.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, aku ke sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.54,0:23:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Silakan masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.75,0:23:17.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karen, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.19,0:23:28.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Se-Sedang apa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karen?
